+The result is **Objective Internality as pramāṇa**: the constituted means through which Subjective Immediacy knows and acts within a World. Language, memory, affect, bodily orientation, other people, tools, institutions and inherited rules participate in these means. Changing their relations changes what can appear, matter and be done. Life / Mind holds knower, means and known together; the means remains a differentiated office within that whole.
+
+An artificial agent’s structured, revisable context-world makes one technical instance investigable through states, traces, relations and consequences. Its thrown horizon establishes what can count as relevant, possible, valuable or actionable from where it stands. A database may contribute to that horizon; the operative relation includes how the source is selected, understood, permitted and used. Inspection discloses this technical explicate order and its implication in a wider field. Such inspection establishes determinate relations within the means; the question of phenomenal localisation retains its own warrant.
